==Strategy==
This stage will aim at swarming you with various high-pressure attackers over time. Thankfully, this means you will have practically unlimited cash to hold off the Bore variants with [[Flower Cat (Special Cat)|Bombercat]], [[Apple Cat (Super Rare Cat)|iCat]] and [[Hip Hop Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Can Can Cat]]. Additionally, the Cat Cannon chunks over half of Razorback's HP; you can save it for when he's about to Strengthen, so you don't have to deal with the damage buff at all. This will usually end up sniping Bore too, who is not a problem in the slightest. Just stall the enemies with lots of meatshields, use [[Weightlifter Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Pizza Cat]] and [[Ancient Egg: N101 (Rare Cat)|Courier Cat]] to absolutely eviscerate them. [[Talents|Talented]] [[Dom Cat (Special Cat)|Dark Lazer]] in particular is overwhelmingly powerful here, frying every enemy's HP with devastating Wave Attacks while being immune to Puffzerker's Weaken.

Bakoo does nothing.

